tests/errors/coroutines.gael:3:7: error: poll takes a coroutine, which (coroutine (f ...)) makes; this is int
tests/errors/coroutines.gael:4:8: error: sleep takes seconds as a float, like (sleep 0.5); this is int
tests/errors/coroutines.gael:5:12: error: coroutine takes a call of a function by its name: (coroutine (patrol goblin))
