tests/errors/coroutines.gael:7:15: error: f: argument 1 is string, it must be int
tests/errors/coroutines.gael:8:1: error: yield takes nothing: (yield)
tests/errors/coroutines.gael:9:8: error: done? takes a coroutine, which (coroutine (f ...)) makes; this is (vec int)
tests/errors/coroutines.gael:10:34: error: + works on numbers, not (option int)
tests/errors/coroutines.gael:11:6: error: u is declared (coroutine unit), its value is (coroutine int)
tests/errors/coroutines.gael:12:1: error: poll gives what a coroutine's function returns, and this one returns nothing; (done? co) says whether it ended
